    {"page": 2, "start": 1261, "end": 1342, "top": 112.2, "left": 181.8, "lastX": 538.8, "baseline": 122.93, "inkLeft": 181.51, "text": "stand in the shallows. When the ferry docks, a short queue forms along the jetty "},
    {"page": 2, "start": 1342, "end": 1395, "top": 126.0, "left": 181.8, "lastX": 416.4, "baseline": 136.37, "inkLeft": 181.51, "text": "and the deckhand coils the rope with practised ease.\u000d"},
    {"page": 2, "start": 1395, "end": 1497, "top": 145.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 540.0, "baseline": 155.81, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "A well-made map leaves out far more than it shows. The cartographer decides which roads matter, which "},
    {"page": 2, "start": 1497, "end": 1602, "top": 158.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 526.8, "baseline": 169.25, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "rivers deserve a name and where a label may sit without hiding a village. Every choice trades detail for "},
    {"page": 2, "start": 1602, "end": 1704, "top": 172.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 522.6, "baseline": 182.69, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "clarity, and the reader trusts the result because the trades were made carefully and applied the same "},
    {"page": 2, "start": 1704, "end": 1732, "top": 185.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 197.4, "baseline": 196.13, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "way across the whole sheet.\u000d"},
    {"page": 2, "start": 1732, "end": 1842, "top": 204.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 539.4, "baseline": 215.35, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "In the workshop the lamps stay lit late. Shavings gather under the bench, a kettle ticks as it cools, and the "},
